window.products.push({"id":611011,"name":"Ramekins 8 oz with Lids - Mini Covered Casserole Dish, Creme Brulee Ramekins Oven Safe, Souffle Dish, Pot Pie Baking Dishes Set of 4, Reactive Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HpLsYPGxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXCELLENT VERSATILITY - With a capacity of 8 ounces, you can use the adorable ramekin for a wide range of things. Use these small, but mighty dishes for prep work to keep your ingredients portioned and close at hand, to serve condiments or small snacks like nuts, or to cook side dishes like individual portions of mac and cheese, main dishes like mini chicken pot pie, French onion soup or desserts like chocolate lava cake. GREAT FOR SERVING & STORING FOOD - Mini cocotte will amaze your guests with its practicality. Handles make them very easy to move from oven to table, or from table to fridge or cabinet. Mini casserole dishes come with lids, which makes it easy to heat and store leftovers, as well as keeping the dish warm. You can also use them to hold items like olives and picked for holiday charcuterie boards. EASY TO CLEAN & STACKABLE - These beautiful souffle dishes stack neatly for convenient storage. The mini covered casserole pots are glazed for a completely smooth surface, which eases the release of baked goods and makes cleaning a breeze. They’re also oven, dishwasher, microwave, and freezer safe. NOTE: NOT FOR STOVE TOPS DURABILITY AND SAFETY - The oven soup bowl is made of durable porcelain, a lead-free, chip-resistant material that offers even heating and excellent heat retention. You can use these small ramekins for long-term daily use as they won't absorb odors, flavors or colors. A CHOICE OF SWEET GIFTS - Ramekins with lids are packaged with the highest quality foams to ensure their safety during transit. This set of 4 ramekins makes a wonderful gift idea, especially as a housewarming gift, Christmas gift, or Thanksgiving gift for anyone who enjoys cooking or baking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HpLsYPGxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HENXFEN LEAD","source_asin":"B0B4JJ8LQD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4JJ8LQD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4JJ8LQD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
