window.products.push({"id":611014,"name":"by Mall 2 packs durable chopper 5мм and 8мм for chopping eggs, hard boiled eggs, fruit cubes, salad cutters, boiled vegetables and tomato cutter, pota","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LX2VqswVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The same OLIVIER with sausage, canned peas and cucumbers! On the New Year's table, there can be a lot of snacks and a variety of salads. but Olivier always takes the most honorable place on the festive table!I offer you the simplest and most classic version of this salad, which is so loved by our compatriots. The main secret of a delicious Olivier is in good and fresh products. Choose fresh boiled sausage and be guided not by the low cost of \"varenka\" or doctor's sausage, but by its quality, it is impossible to prepare a delicious dish from low-quality ingredients. Green peas choose brain varieties - it is sweet, delicious and more tender. And take only high-fat mayonnaise, if you want your Olivier to turn out really tasty, no mayonnaise with a reduced fat content will give the SAME Classic TASTE! Посмотрите Watch a short VIDEO RECIPE to make the cooking process simple and clear! INGREDIENTS boiled sausage (or ham) 300 g potatoes (medium) 3-4 pieces carrots 1 piece eggs 4 pcs pickled cucumbers 2-3 medium or 6-8 small cucumbers peas (canned) 1 jar (200 g) mayonnaise to taste salt freshly ground pepper Imagine you are surrounded by egg-based appetizers,mashed potato,cobb salad,banana split,jambalaya,strawberry ice cream ect. Isn't it beautiful? Don't miss out on Fruit Cube Cutter.You'll have the time of your life. Outer diameter: 3.4 inches (86 mm) Cutting size: 0,2 inches (5 mm) Best part it does not have any sharp edges and cuts in precise sizes NOTE: 1.due to the light and screen setting difference, the color may be slightly different from the pictures. Please allow slight dimension difference due to different manual measurement. 2.Hand washing recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LX2VqswVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"byMall","source_asin":"B095J23T1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095J23T1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095J23T1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
