window.products.push({"id":611078,"name":"Tafts Bamboo Sheets Queen Size Bed Sheets 5 Piece Set, Pure 100% Organic Bamboo, 17” Deep Pockets – Luxuriously Soft, Silky Smooth, Cooling, Double St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716Lubnr6XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌿 CERTIFIED 100% ORGANIC BAMBOO SHEETS (NO “BAMBOO”-ZLES) - Designed in Houston, TX and crafted with 100% Organic Bamboo which is luxuriously soft, cooling, and never blended with any other fabrics or fibers (check competitors carefully). Taft's 100% Organic Bamboo Sheets are Certified OEKO-TEX Standard 100 (Certificate # 21.HUS.74590) and have been third-party verified as 100% pure organic bamboo and tested free from over 100 harmful substances to ensure your safety. 🌡 COOLING, THERMO-REGULATING + MOISTURE-WICKING - Tafts’ 400TC (top shelf) bamboo fabric is naturally cooling, made of breathable bamboo fibers that are thermoregulating keeping you (and your toes) comfortable during all seasons. The moisture-wicking properties of Taft's bamboo sheets keep your skin dry and comfortable. Taft's bamboo sheets are the ultimate in luxury and cooling softness making it feel like you’re sleeping on cloud nine, y’all. 🛏 COMPLETE 5-PIECE QUEEN SET + DEEP FITTED - Includes 1 fabric bag, 1 fitted sheet, 1 flat sheet and 2 envelope closure style pillowcases. Tafts’ Bamboo Sheet Set comes with extra-deep pockets that are 360° elasticized, so you don’t have to worry about the corners coming up on mattresses up to 17” tall. The fitted sheet, the flat sheet and the pillowcases feature high quality double-stitched sewn seams for durability and to ensure they withstand the test of time. ☁️ SUPERIOR 400TC SATEEN WEAVE - SOFTER WITH EVERY WASH - Tafts bamboo sheets are made from 400 thread count sateen weave fabric for a silky smooth feel that is softer and more durable than even 1500 thread count cotton. Our 3rd-party SGS report (see below) shows that our 400TC bamboo fibers are more durable, resilient and resistant to pilling than 300TC or less bamboo. Easy care through cold water washing which actually enhances the luscious silky feeling and gets softer with every wash. 🌎 LIFETIME GUARANTEE, SUSTAINABLY SOURCED - Taft's is committed to quality materials and the highest level of craftsmanship. Every Taft's bamboo sheet is secured by a Lifetime Guarantee against defects in materials and workmanship directly out of our headquarters in Houston, TX USA. Always wash with cold water and tumble dry on low heat to maintain optimal quality and performance over time. Bamboo is eco-friendly and is one of the fastest growing and most sustainable resources on the planet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716Lubnr6XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tafts","source_asin":"B0B5NK7NQP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5NK7NQP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5NK7NQP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":611079,"name":"Famiware Plates and Bowls Set, 12 Pieces Dinnerware Sets, Dishes Set for 4, Multi-color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lJ8EOivqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【WHAT WILL YOU GET?】This dinnerware set includes 4*10” dinner plates, 4*7.5” salad plates, 4*5.5” cereal bowls. This is a great combination for a family dinner party. 【STONEWARE WITH ORGANIC CLAY】The organic clay not only giving you rich representation, but also provides stronger and more durable stoneware, Our organic clay has optimal heat retention to keep your food hotter longer. 【DISHWASHER AND MICROWAVE SAFE】Our dishes have passed microwave and dishwasher safe testing at internationally accredited laboratories. Each plate and bowl is 100% dishwasher safe and microwave safe. 【PERFECT FOR A GIFT】Famiware dishes dinnerware sets are popular with young people with exquisite glaze and unique design. Perfect gift for housewarming, Thanksgiving, Christmas and fun celebrations. 【LEAD FREE ALL NATURAL GLAZE】ALL our plates and bowls are made of 100% lead-free glaze. You can safely use them to serve steaks, salads or desserts. 【FUN SPECKLED DESIGN】These rounded dishes feature a minimalist design. Spruce up meal time with these neutral pieces that feature a brown speckled pattern, making each piece unique. 【SCRATCH RESISTANT】Our glaze is fired at 2340℉ for 13.5 hours to form a strong scratch resistant surface. No need to worry about scratches from your forks or knives. 【STACKABLE & EASY TO CLEAN】These dishes are stackable and don't take up a lot of space in your cupboard. Easy to clean, you can wash them with foam and water or place them into your dishwasher. 【FAMIWARE' S PROMISE】We promise to send you replacements for free if you receive some pieces that is damaged during shipping, simply send us a message on Amazon and our service is available daily to hear your request. Thanks for choosing Famiware! Famiware is dedicated to creating healthy and safe dinnerware that turns every time you cooking and eating into a warm experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lJ8EOivqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"famiware","source_asin":"B0BB7J1SV3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB7J1SV3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB7J1SV3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
