window.products.push({"id":611110,"name":"HIDBEA Window Privacy Film,Frosted Decorate Door Clings,Flash Stained Glass Tint Decals,Anti-UV Heat Control Sticker,Vinyl DIY Covering Non-Adhesive (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711TFLr7LAS._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"This frosted window film gives you a designer look and all the privacy you desire. The privacy window film can also let the sunshine in while keeping the outside world out, no more nosy neighbors but a cool beautiful environment. Installation Steps: 1. Thoroughly clean stains on the window or glass surface.  2. Measure the size of your window or glass and cut the film to a suitable size. Please remember to leave about a 2 mm gap from the edge of the glass to the film. 3. Peel off the protective film (transparent film), spray a lot of soapy water both onto the window, and the backside of the static film. 4. Install the wet side of the static film onto the wet glass, smooth the film with hands. 5. Use the squeegee at a 45-degree angle to remove extra water and air from the center with proper strength. 6. Wipe out the surface water with a lint-free towel. Note: If the paste effect is not satisfactory, you can tear it off and paste it again. BASIC INFORMATION: Product Type: Glass Window Film  Installation Type: Static Cling  Features: Static cling without glue and reusable Size: 17.5 Inches x 6.5 feet(44.5x200cm) Thickness: 0.21mm (Available Section) Function：privacy protection, heat control, energy-saving, decorative landscaping，anti-glare, block out harmful rays Ideal for smooth glass surfaces in the bathroom, kitchen, bedroom, living room, office, hotels, lobby, etc. Package Included: 1 x Frosted Window Film NOTE: Please allow a 5mm error in size as manual cutting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711TFLr7LAS._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIDBEA","source_asin":"B08YDPJT2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YDPJT2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YDPJT2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":611111,"name":"Route One Apparel | Maryland Flag Can Cooler, Insulated Can Sleeves for Soda, Beer, Water & Cold Beverages","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WKoJQycZL._AC_UL1024_.jpg","description":"MARYLAND CAN COOLER: A uniquely printed Maryland insulated can cooler to represent our pride in our state... and partying. LOCALLY MADE: This state inspired can cooler is made right here in Maryland to ensure an authentic look and feel. INDIVIDUALLY SEWN: Each of these stylish can coolers are made and sewn in house to ensure the highest quality product. THE PERFECT GIFT: This can cooler is perfect for any Maryland fan, near or far! You could gift it to your uncle in Nebraska, your neighbor down the street, or to a friend overseas. No matter where they are, Marylanders know where their heart belongs! SHOW SOME PRIDE: What better way to show your pride for this beautiful state than combine the bold colors of the flag, with the usefulness and longevity of a can cooler.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WKoJQycZL._AC_UL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Route One Apparel","source_asin":"B019QQM272","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019QQM272","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019QQM272","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
