window.products.push({"id":611155,"name":"Citrusafe Grill Cleaner, 23 Oz Bottle, Pack of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uRq8C5cZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CitruSafe is a pioneer in the grilling industry by manufacturing the first spray specifically formulated to provide a simple, safe, yet powerful alternative to cleaning a barbecue grill’s cooking surfaces (grates). CitruSafe BBQ Grill Cleaner utilizes the cleaning power of citrus peels to provide a natural degreaser. CitruSafe not only saves fuel, but also avoids the unnecessary risks associated with ingesting bristles from wire grill brushes. Special Features: CitruSafe BBQ Grill Cleaner cleans your grill safely and effectively. Works great on gas grills, charcoal grills, cookers, smokers, ovens, microwaves, and more! Non-flammable, non-corrosive, non-toxic, biodegradable, and phosphate free. Save money on fuel by cleaning your grill cool. Utilizes citrus-based degreaser to provide safe and powerful cleaning. For use exclusively on a COOL grill. Works best with any CitruSafe CLEAN COOL grill cleaning tools. Super Effective: Utilizing the power of citrus (d-limonene), CitruSafe BBQ Grill Cleaner has been specifically designed to provide you a simple and powerful alternative to cleaning your BBQ grill's cooking surface (grids). Directions: - APPLY TO COOL SURFACES ONLY. 1) Liberally apply to the grill’s COOL cooking surface and surrounding areas soiled with grease spatter. 2) Wait approximately one minute, allowing the CitruSafe to penetrate the grease. 3) Scrub the cooking surface with heavy-duty grill scrubber, non-wire grill brush, or similar. Wipe clean grates with a damp, high-quality paper towel. 4) Always turn nozzle to “OFF” position before storing. Made in the USA!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uRq8C5cZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Citrusafe","source_asin":"B09J3WHTFC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J3WHTFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J3WHTFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
