window.products.push({"id":611195,"name":"Silicone Oven Mitts and Pot Holders Sets, MTZRFLL Extra Long Heat Resistant Oven Gloves with Hot Pads and Mini Oven Mits Set for Kitchen Cooking Bakin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IZengMEfS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【Professional Kitchen Accessory】Our set comes with 2 extra long kitchen mittens, 2 cooking pinch mitts and 2 hot pads (7.3x7.3\"), Each piece is crafted with flexible, Durable silicone (BPA-free), They won’t fray, thin or tear. You can work on the oven, stove or BBQ with less worry, especially when pulling out hot pans, serving hot plates, or placing utensils on a nice hardwood table. The Perfect choice for any family. ❤【Heat Resistance up to 500°F】Outer liner: Made of food-grade silicone and won't absorb liquids, the 15-inch extra long oven mitts safeguard hands and forearms from burns and steam scalds. Inner liner: Made of 100% high-quality natural cotton, offering comfort and breathability without sacrificing dexterity. Safety is our top priority! ❤【Easy to Clean and Store】These silicone oven mitt sets are stain resistant and easy to clean, just need some warm water and a little soap to refresh them, also they are safe to wash/dry in the washing machine. The friendly hanging design is easy to store and save more kitchen space. ❤【Practical & Versatile】The unique non-slip honeycomb textured surface helps you grip on to hot pots, pans, air fryers, utensils. Our trivet mats can not only protect your beloved table from scalding, but also be used as a jar opener, hot pot holder, large coaster, spoon rest. ❤【Ideal Gift for Any Cook】Perfectly sized in the hands of both men and women, kitchen gloves will make their time in the kitchen easier and safer, and are ideal gifts for family or friends. We insist on ensuring high quality standards to customers. Feel free to contact us if you have any questions, we are always at here for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IZengMEfS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MTZRFLL","source_asin":"B08F47MRBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F47MRBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F47MRBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":611196,"name":"Pink and Beautiful by Kurt Shaffer, 16x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cdj+1O8CL._AC_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a photograph of a pink rose. Kurt Shaffer has been a self-taught photographer since age 13 (1970). He continues to learn the fine art of photography, especially in this fantastic digital age. Though Kurt does not manipulate his fine art photography, digital enhancement is a valuable tool in his business. He states that if he were to change anything in his work it would be to make it look more like it was when he took the original photo. Kurt's love of the earth feeds his photographic creativity and defines it as his truest form of therapy. When photographing people, capturing the nature in his subjects is Kurt's intent and what he strives to do. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cdj+1O8CL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B005N2E9JS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005N2E9JS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005N2E9JS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
