window.products.push({"id":611254,"name":"Outer Mountain Tide Clock - Nautical Clock - Tidal Clock - Tide Clock High Tide Low Tide and Wall Tide Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716oh359-2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our tide wall clock allows you to see the state of the tide at a glance! It is 11.75 inches by 11.75 inches and tells you whether the tide is coming in, going out, and the time remaining before high tide or low tide.Our Outer Mountain Brand Tide Clock is hand made with a high-quality Eco-Friendly bamboo and wood material. We use a laser to etch our designs, so it’s bold and stands out on the Nautical clock. Our Hight Tide Low Tide Clock is extremely easy to read and offers a statement piece to any office, living room, bathroom or entryway. We used a flush mount so our Nautical Tide Clock will sit flush on your wall and not rock back and forth. Our tide clock uses a mute sweeping movement and will be silent in your home. Tide Timers are a perfect gift for anyone with a coastal home, boat, fishermen, swimmers, surfers, beach walkers, beachcombers or anyone with a love of the ocean! They offer a simple, reliable way to keep track of high and low tides! The tides operate on moon time, where each tidal day has 24 hours and 50 1/2 minutes, so high tide and low tides do not occur at the same hour each day. The Tide Timer’s hand easily shows how many hours until the next High Tide or Low Tide in your area. Tide Clocks are recommended for use on both Coasts of the United States and Canada. On the Atlantic they never need adjustment. On the Pacific, including Hawaii, they need to be calibrated regularly. Tide Clocks do not operate in the Gulf of Mexico. We want you to be confident in your purchase and for that reason we offer a 100% Money Back GUARANTEE no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716oh359-2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Outer Mountain","source_asin":"B09B19G8VJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B19G8VJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B19G8VJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":611255,"name":"Kook Sugar and Creamer Set, 3 Piece, Pitcher, Sugar Bowl with Lid and Spoon, Sweetener Holder, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z-TrQVZkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️ Classic Charm : Includes everything you need for your home coffee bar! Comes with a milk and creamer dispenser, sugar container complete with a lid and mini spoon, and sweetener packet holder. ✔️ Perfect Size: Compact design fits snugly onto any countertop or kitchen table and holds just enough cream and sugar. ✔️ Easy Clean: Stick right into the dishwasher for super simple cleanup. It’s microwave safe too! ✔️ Smooth & Sturdy: Designed with simple and elegant white ceramic to blend seamlessly into any kitchen decor. ✔️ Perfect Condition Guarantee: We’ve carefully packaged this Sugar and Creamer Set with polyfoam to ensure it arrives in tip-top shape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z-TrQVZkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KooK","source_asin":"B08N2WZM52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N2WZM52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N2WZM52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":611256,"name":"LANE LINEN 6 PC Bathroom Towels Sets Clearance- 2 Large Bath Towels Set, 2 Turkish Hand Towels for Bathroom Clearance & 2 Wash Towels for Body, Hotel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1r2hOsCYpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LANE LINEN towels are not only incredibly soft and comfortable on your skin, but they also provide superior absorbency for quick and convenient drying. These Luxury Bath Towels come in beautiful solid colors that will coordinate well with any bathroom decor. We are confident in the durability and softness of our premium bath towels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1r2hOsCYpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LANE LINEN","source_asin":"B09FHZWHNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FHZWHNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FHZWHNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":611257,"name":"Seatsnoozer V2 - Travel Pillow and Neck Pillow As Seen on Kickstarter! Amazon Exclusive. Special holiday price with!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41SkFZv5iCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Sleeping on airplanes sucks and regular U-shaped travel pillows and neck pillows always fell short. That's why we came up with SeatSnoozer V2, with many improvements over our original version. The SeatSnoozer prevents head bobbing from taking place, while trying to sleep in a seated position. It also provides adjustable, vertical and lateral head and neck support. This makes the SeatSnoozer ideal for sleeping during prolonged air travel. One size fits all users. Throughout the design process, we focused on: minimizing weight (3.4 oz), comfort, keeping it highly packable, functional and ready for use right out of your bag with no inflating or complicated setup. In the end it became different from standard travel pillows, in every way. The SeatSnoozer looks unique and it is! Let’s face it; U-Shaped neck pillows didn’t look too normal when they first hit the market. What is it and how does it work? While it took quite a bit of work to identify proper angles and functionality, the finished product is actually quite simple. The benefit is that it keeps your head and neck in place. It has a tail that acts as an anchor. You lift your head, you drop the anchor on your back and as you sit back and relax, your own body keeps head and neck in place.The \"anchor\" system makes it infinitely adjustable. After you fit it the first time, you can leave it setup for future use. If that sounds confusing, I recommend watching our video above which demonstrates this more effectively than I explain via text :) - Extra large ear cut outs allow users to use noise cancelling headphones. - Compatible with most sleep masks (Sold Separately) - Made of soft fleece at all skin contact points - Easy to clean nylon on the outside - Ultra compact and weight only 3.4 Ounces! - This product was a huge success on Kickstarter and is finally back in stock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41SkFZv5iCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SeatSnoozer Travel Sleeping Device","source_asin":"B00R702WV6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00R702WV6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00R702WV6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
