window.products.push({"id":611402,"name":"Lazy Chef Wooden and Acrylic Salt and Pepper Grinder Set of 2 | 8\" Salt and Pepper Shakers Refillable | 7oz. Capacity and Adjustable Coarseness with a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f+RD3ds6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All Natural Environmentally Conscious Plantation HardwoodDurable and built to last for the long haul, our wood salt and pepper grinders are made from all-natural plantation hardwood, making these wooden salt and pepper mills environmentally conscious and built for the modern kitchen.Modern and Functional DesignCrafted with an acrylic core, our salt and pepper wooden grinders are modern and functional in design. The ½” thick core is transparent, allowing users to easily see how much salt or pepper remains in their shaker after each use. Ceramic Grinding Core for a Variety of CoarsenessEach grinder core is adjustable in coarseness from fine to medium to coarse to ensure that your meal is properly seasoned every time. Adjusting the coarseness is easy and effortless and only requires a gentle untwisting of the top screw of each salt and pepper grinderEasy Refills that are Made to LastRefills are a breeze and only require the top screws to be removed and the cap is taken off to allow for a seamless refill of the wood salt and pepper core. Our Lazy Chef 8” wooden salt and pepper grinders are built to last and are designed with durable, anticorrosive steel to ensure that the core is always sharp enough to grind any ingredients you care to throw at it.Complete both the modern and rustic kitchen style with our wood and acrylic 8” Lazy Chef salt and pepper shakers!“Let’s get cookin!”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f+RD3ds6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lazy Chef","source_asin":"B09FH2QWSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FH2QWSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FH2QWSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":611403,"name":"Cybrtrayd 45St50-A054 Bee Lolly Chocolate Candy Mold with 50 Cybrtrayd 4.5 Lollipop Sticks by CybrTrayd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sxJia0hsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques. To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision. Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sxJia0hsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B00EU59ZEI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EU59ZEI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EU59ZEI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
