window.products.push({"id":611449,"name":"Novilla King Mattress - 10 Inch Serenity Gel Memory Foam Hybrid Mattress, Medium Firm Pocket Innerspring King Size Mattress with Edge Support, Motion ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E5IkmESWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESIGNED FOR ALL SLEEPER TYPES - Finding a mattress that works for all the sleeping positions can be a challenge, but is possible with Novilla Serenity king mattress. It with cooling gel memory foam and medium firm core support system to provide each sleeping position a good amount of support, from the stomach to the side to the back, to keep the body and spine aligned. MOTION ISOLATION KEEPS SLEEP SOUNDLY - Novilla hybrid mattress limits the motion transfer you feel from partners or pets that move during the night, the pocket spring work independently of each other so that a combination sleeper’s partner will not be disturbed when they change positions, fast response foam with just enough bounce so that moving in bed is easy without feeling stuck. COMEFORTABLE AND HEALTHY - Novilla innerspring mattress has bamboo rayon fabric cover and thick layer of gel memory foam to help cooling and increase comfortable as you’re asleep,foam is eco-friendly material with CertiPUR-US certified . SMART SHPPING＆PLACE ON MOST OF SURFACE King size: Measures 76\" W x 80\" D x 10\" H and fits most kinds of twin bed frames, includes box springs, flat frames, slats or even the floor. Mattress comes compressed and rolled for shipping and setup so convenient your kids can help. This universally comfortable mattress makes relaxing easy. Mattress is recommended 72 hours for air out and reshape. Easy TO CARRY & 10 YEAR LIMIT WARRANTY - Your king mattress is convenient to move by 4 handles, there are two on each side. You can enjoy your comfortable sleep with our mattress which is covered by a 10-year limit warranty. Any dissatisfaction problems please contact our professional customer support team - nights, weekends, and holidays are also available. We commit to making sure you enjoy a lifetime of good sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E5IkmESWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Novilla","source_asin":"B0BC3GFG8X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC3GFG8X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC3GFG8X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
