window.products.push({"id":611473,"name":"Chef'n StalkChop Stalk Chopper, Non-Slip Handle, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515UlYZln-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cauliflower is quickly becoming a healthy alternative to heavy starches like potatoes and rice. The Chef'n Stalk Chop Cauliflower Prep Tool is perfect to create those delicious and carb-free meals. Easy to use; just press down to chop the core of the cauliflower using the ergonomic handle. Use to make mashed cauliflower, cauliflower rice or just steam up the cauliflower and enjoy. Works great on broccoli or other stemmed vegetables, too. Dishwasher safe and stores easily. Choose smart, easy-to-use, kitchen utensils that are built on tasteful design, new technologies, and the trusted reputation of Chef'n.HOW TO USE:Press down to chop and remove cauliflower florets. Place in dishwasher to clean.Chef. Chef’n tools and gadgets are designed to be powerful in their simplicity, so that you can delight in simple food prep tasks as much as in the moments spent around the table. Less time prepping, more time enjoying. We create products that make experimentation in the kitchen approachable and fun for the chef in all of us. We aim to inspire creativity and shareable experiences in the kitchen. Our tools are approachable so that everyone can experience a healthy-ish lifestyle through intentional at-home food prep. The Chef’n design team focuses on solving problems in the kitchen with innovative, clever solutions. The result is high quality, well designed products that promote and encourage cooking and eating with family and friends at home. We want food prep to be less tedious and more enjoyable for you so that time in your kitchen can be a delicious experience to share. With playful prep and clever cooking let’s make healthy meals and happy kitchens!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515UlYZln-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef'n","source_asin":"B07ZQYYNBY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZQYYNBY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZQYYNBY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
