window.products.push({"id":611629,"name":"ROJASOP Large Shoe Rack Storage Organizer for Closet Entryway, 62-66 Pairs Sturdy Tall Shoe Rack for Closet with Side Hooks Garage Shoe Rack Stackable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715D9SGAh0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Shoe Organizer with Large Capacity - Our 4-row 8-tier large shoe rack holds up to 62-66 pairs of shoes, with dimensions being 12\"D x 66\"W x 55\"H. It is a great shoe rack for closet, entryway, bedroom and dorm. Moreover, there are 6 larger cells where you can store high boots, big toys and other storage organization boxes. Diyable and Dividable Shoe Shelf - The metal shoe rack is stackable and dividable. You are free to split it into 1 3-row-8-tier shoe organizer for closet and 1 4-tier shoe stand for entryway, or into 1 2-row-3-tier closet organizer with large cells and 1 3-row-5-tier shoe organizer for entryway. There is always a suitable option for you. Considerate Handy Designs - This shoe holder comes with 10 pieces of waterproof PP sheets which is super convenient for storing high heels or for raining occasions. There will be no more heels falling through the slots or water dripping into other shoes. Besides, 2 packs of 5 side hooks are included, so you can collect and organize your keys, hats, bags or umbrellas. Sturdy and Durable Shoe Storage - Our large shoe shelf is made of powder-coated metal tubes and strengthened high-quality plastic parts, making it sturdy, durable and capable of heavy duty without shaking and tipping. The metal tubes adopt anti-rust processing technology, which greatly improves its lifespan. Easy to Assemble and Portable - Installation for this shoe rack is easy. A user manual with detailed step-by-step illustration is included in the package. You can also refer to the video uploaded in the photo gallery section. The shoe rack organizer is light weight and super portable. Even a young girl is able to move it easily (when it’s not loaded).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715D9SGAh0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROJASOP","source_asin":"B0B7VX6VWF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7VX6VWF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7VX6VWF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
