window.products.push({"id":611701,"name":"Jar in a Jar - 2-in-1 Glass Mason Jar Fitted with A Smaller Jar Inside Under One Leak Proof Lid Perfect for Storage & Food On The Go – By Consol (34oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31QP8wN7WCL._AC_.jpg","description":"On the go consumption just got a whole lot easier with the introduction of Consol’s Jar in a Jar. Perfect for soup and croutons, pap and gravy, salad and a creamy dressing, fruit salad and yoghurt – there are plenty of meals where some of the ingredients are best kept separate until just prior to serving. Now with the Consol Jar in a Jar there’s no need to limit the defining elements of a dish, nor the gourmet garnish. No more soggy salads and no compromise when it comes to taste or texture while eating on the run; every meal can be enjoyed as it was intended. From meals at the office, to picnics, school lunches, trips to the beach, and snacks on the run, the Consol Jar in a Jar is the ideal two-in-one container to store elements of a meal separately but together. Not limited to food, it also has a definite place in a nursery where dummies can be stored hygienically together with the gripe water in a sterile environment. They are also ideal for storing stationery and crafting materials, as well as sprinkles, cupcake casings and other baking essentials. The jars and lids are dishwasher safe but avoid cleaning with abrasives. They will crack if exposed to extreme heat or cold and should not therefore be stored in a freezer, nor heated in an oven or in a microwave. They are not suitable for carbonated products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31QP8wN7WCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Consol","source_asin":"B01M09UDEC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M09UDEC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M09UDEC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
