window.products.push({"id":611932,"name":"Turkish Coffee Forged Handmade Copper Pot - With Turkish Kurukahveci Mehmet Efendi Coffee Cezve - Wooden Spoon - Greek Armenian Arabic Coffee Machine ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LiRiMfWcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Turkish Coffee Making Instructions (for 2 people): Place the sugar (if desired), 2 Turkish coffee cup-sized cups of cold filtered water, and 1 heaping tablespoons Turkish Coffee (ground) in copper Turkish coffee pot Using a small spoon, stir briefly until just combined and place pot on stovetopSlowly bring coffee mixture to a boil over medium heat. This will take 3-4 minutes, so keep a close watchAs the coffee warms, you will see a dark foam building up. Closer to it coming to a boil, using a teaspoon, transfer some of the foam into each of your two Turkish coffee cups. Return coffee pot to stovetopAs coffee comes to a boil, pour half of the coffee into the cups, over the foamReturn coffee pot to stovetop and boil the remaining coffee for an additional 15-20 seconds and pour the rest in to the coffee cups to the rim serve with water and Turkish delight. Cleaning: - It is easy to clean. You can rinse and dry after each use.- For cleaning dishcloth or sponge is the best. Never use abrasive cleaning materials like scouring pads or metal scrapers on your coffee pot. Package: 1 x Copper Turkish Coffe Pot1 x 100 Gram Kurukahveci Mehmet Efendi Coffe 1 x wooden spoon","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LiRiMfWcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iparalde","source_asin":"B086RWX5KN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611932","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086RWX5KN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086RWX5KN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
