window.products.push({"id":611985,"name":"Brentwood Home Coronado Gel Memory Foam Mattress, Made in California, King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718iH9Ah-mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Coronado combines traditional mattress craftsmanship with the comfort of gel memory foam. Simply run your fingers along the tailored tweed sides, button-tufted upholstery, or the plush Eurotop cushion to feel the attention to detail. Hand-stitched tape edges and four-way stretch knit on top help you reap the full rewards of memory foam, keeping your mattress from bowing and supporting you fully every night and every morning. Most important, gel memory foam contours your entire body, with a ventilated foam layer keeping you cool. Coronado is Spanish for “the crowned one.” We’d like to think our Coronado places that crown upon your sleepyhead. About Brentwood Home HEALTHY MATERIALS From our bedroom to our cities to the planet we call home, taking care of the spaces we inhabit is the foundation of our well-being. At Brentwood Home, much of the product development process is spent researching and sourcing materials ourselves, making sure they meet Golden State standards for environmental responsibility. HANDCRAFTING EXCELLENCE Brentwood Home has over 30 years of handcrafting experience here in Los Angeles, and our history has left us with an artisanal approach to manufacturing. From hand-tufted wool rosettes to beautiful quilted Euro-tops, you’ll be able to feel the attention to detail in every stitch. HONEST PRICES Our manufacturing experience allows us to control every aspect of production, and a lack of middle-men means affordable, honest prices. All of our mattresses ship free, with a 25-year warranty. CALIFORNIA ETHOS California has always been at the forefront of environmental regulation, implementing policies that are eventually followed by the rest of the country. We meet and exceed these standards by using a combination of organic, nontoxic, and natural materials with no chemical fire retardants, phthalates, or heavy metals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718iH9Ah-mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brentwood Home","source_asin":"B01GFLDRLQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-611985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GFLDRLQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GFLDRLQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
